# Nothing Playground UI Overhaul Plan

This implementation plan outlines the structural, typographic, and cosmetic changes to adapt the Lenny's Growth Assistant chat interface into an authentic **Nothing Playground / Essential UI** style. 

The styling will focus on pure dark theme backgrounds, dot-matrix aesthetics, monospace utilities, sharp/rectangular card modules with 1px borders, subtle red accents, and custom animations.

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Key Design Decisions:**
> 1. **Pure Dark Mode by Default:** The background will be `#000000` (Pure Black) with a white/grey subtle dot-matrix background grid, aligned with the actual Nothing Playground website.
> 2. **Dot Matrix Typography:** We will import Google Fonts' **Doto** font for large headers, status displays, numbers, and the monogram. Standard sans-serif text (chat history) will remain on a clean geometric font (`Inter`), and code will use `JetBrains Mono`.
> 3. **Reduced Corner Radii:** The corner radii will be reduced from standard iOS/macOS rounded shapes (16px/24px) to Nothing-spec: 6px/8px for standard components, and sharp borders for grid cells.
> 4. **Nothing Signal Red Accent:** The color `#D71921` will be introduced as the signature Nothing red accent for status indicators, active hover borders, and error messages.

