## Proposed Changes

We will modify the frontend files to adjust the layout elements and CSS theme configurations. No backend modifications will be made.

### Core Configuration & Global Styling

#### [MODIFY] [tailwind.config.js](file:///d:/Lenny%27s%20Growth%20Assistant/frontend/tailwind.config.js)
- Update the colors theme config to reflect Nothing Playground's palette:
  - `bg-base` / `bg-canvas` -> `#000000` (Pure Black)
  - `bg-surface` -> `#0C0C0C` (Dark Grey cards/modules)
  - `bg-elevated` -> `#171717` (Hover states/inputs)
  - `bg-user-msg` -> `#0C0C0C` with solid white/grey border (replaces the current bubble style)
  - `border` -> `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)` (Very thin grey border)
  - `accent` -> `#D71921` (Nothing Signal Red)
- Define a new `fontFamily.display` targeting `['Doto', 'monospace']` for the dot matrix style.

#### [MODIFY] [index.css](file:///d:/Lenny%27s%20Growth%20Assistant/frontend/src/index.css)
- Import Google Fonts `Doto` (dot-matrix display font) and clean typography.
- Add body dot grid background overlay using a radial-gradient with a mix-blend-mode:
  ```css
  body::before {
    content: "";
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07) 1.2px, transparent 1.2px);
    background-size: 24px 24px;
    background-attachment: fixed;
  }
  ```
- Make sure standard prose components (headings, lists, code boxes) use clean monospace highlights and sharp boundaries.

