## Verification Plan

### Automated/Dev Validation
- Run Vite local development server (`npm run dev`) and check for compile/rendering errors.
- Ensure Tailwind's CSS is built successfully.

### Manual UI Verification
1. Verify the background dot-grid behaves correctly upon scrolling.
2. Confirm typography styling matches between Doto font (dot matrix), Inter (sans-serif), and JetBrains Mono.
3. Test layout resizing on mobile viewports.
4. Interact with theme elements (Send button hover, sidebar active state, provider toggle) and verify alignment.
5. Launch and interact with an Artifact to check layout in the Artifact split pane.
